  </div>
  <div class="btn" id="btn-stats">
    <div class="btn-text">STATS</div>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">WASD Move | Space Push | E Grab | Shift Dodge | Q Charge</div>
  <div class="controls">VR: Thumbstick Move | Trigger Push | Grip Grab</div>
</Panel>
